menu "e32p: spi"

    config E32P_SPI_ENABLE
        bool "Enable e32p_spi (SPI master facade)"
        default n
        help
            Bus + device facade over the ESP-IDF v5.x spi_master driver: init a
            host bus, attach devices (own CS / clock / mode), and do full-duplex
            or one-way transfers. Uses SPI2/SPI3 (SPI1 is the flash bus).

endmenu
